==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fates Collide|Pupitar|42}} from the {{TCG|Fates Collide}} expansion.
*'''Speed Attack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Great Encounters|Porygon2|49}} from the {{TCG|Great Encounters}} expansion.
